    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1153-a1">

                <pb facs="1231" n="1135" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1135"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Thomas Machado, in his character as vice-consul of Spain in this city and by
                    order of the Spanish legation in Caracas, hereby makes known to all Spanish
                    subjects to whom these presents shall come, greeting, that:</p>
                <p>From this date there is open in his office a register wherein will be entered the
                    names of all Spanish subjects who may voluntarily wish to aid, either with their
                    persons or their finances, the Government of His Majesty the King in the war to
                    be waged in consequence of the revolution decreed against Spain by the Congress
                    of the United States.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ciudad Bolivar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
